      }
    ],
    [],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          112.10344760101009,
          290.869358251634,
          13.66279703282828
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAC+HelveticaNeue-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Leigh Taliaferro, M.D., values consistency."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          133.5865287247475,
          324.89481944444447,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The Abilene native started his practice 17 years ago"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          150.41165782828284,
          325.335016748366,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "and has developed a flourishing business as a"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          167.2367869318182,
          325.3500735294118,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "general surgeon. He estimates that 90 percent of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          184.06191603535353,
          325.3017712418301,
          13.534659090909145
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "his practice is for abdominal surgery. With such a"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          200.8870321969698,
          325.3560694444444,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "busy practice, he finds comfort in having a reliable"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          217.71223895202024,
          325.0425232843138,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "banking partner. “I have almost every type of busi-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          234.5373680555556,
          324.9461029411765,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "ness, trust and personal account with First National"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          251.36249715909105,
          247.56913766339872,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Bank of Abilene,” says Dr. Taliaferro. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          272.84557828282834,
          324.9867847222222,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "“First National is immersed in this city – everywhere"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          289.66951672979803,
          325.18126674836606,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "you go, they are involved with helping people with"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          306.493545770202,
          325.3802038398693,
          13.534659090909258
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "their business. It’s because of the people who"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          323.3174842171718,
          325.3198427287582,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "work there – they are leaders … generous people"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          340.1415003156567,
          325.4857017973857,
          13.534672032828212
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "who make their mark on the bank and on the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          356.96545170454544,
          325.35454534313726,
          13.534659090909145
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "community. While they may be the biggest bank"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          373.7894289772728,
          325.342587009804,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "in town, they sure don’t act like it. It’s like bank-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          390.61340625,
          113.02433823529412,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "ing with friends.”"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          414.8919160353536,
          325.69678145424837,
          13.534659090909031
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Dr. Taliaferro has invested in First Financial"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          431.7158933080808,
          324.8405547385621,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Bankshares for more than a decade. “My stock has"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          448.53987058080804,
          325.3500902777778,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "done nothing but go up in value. They are solid,"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          465.3638478535354,
          325.16471936274513,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "sound businesspeople. I sleep well at night know-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          66.99346405228758,
          482.1878380681818,
          296.7781985294117,
          13.534672032828325
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAF+HelveticaNeue-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "ing that my investments are in good hands.”"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          112.37566899509804,
          626.7556887626263,
          845.9159743872548,
          67.67691919191918
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            12,
            72,
            142,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAG+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "“While they may be the biggest "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          319.7571241830065,
          687.5803794191919,
          638.5345191993463,
          67.67691919191924
        ],
        "font": {
